# `npm run dev:backend`: the app talks to the real backend in ../backend instead of the
# in-browser demo data. /api is forwarded to it by the proxy in vite.config.ts (port 3000).
# Start the backend first: `npm run dev` in ../backend (see backend/README.md).
VITE_ENABLE_MOCKS=false
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
